{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411140","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1341114001:1":{"text":"哎，被你们这么一问我才意识到，我有快十年没有回部族去看看了。","source_cn":"哎，被你们这么一问我才意识到，我有快十年没有回部族去看看了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C5B441E0085685B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341114002:0":{"text":"格尔达女士，你不会想家吗？","source_cn":"格尔达女士，你不会想家吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C249740E785199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341114003:1":{"text":"亲爱的，当然会想了！我的家乡也有座高山，但只有冬天才下雪，远没有白山这么冷……","source_cn":"亲爱的，当然会想了！我的家乡也有座高山，但只有冬天才下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DCCA06B75D6334F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341114004:1":{"text":"我记得那宏伟又连绵不断的山脉，河水从山上奔腾咆哮着流下，还有一个巨大的河谷平原——我的族人就生活在那儿。","source_cn":"我记得那宏伟又连绵不断的山脉，河水从山上奔腾咆哮着流下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E98DE5C6B1FA18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1341114004":{"text":"我记得那宏伟又连绵不断的山脉，河水从山上奔腾咆哮着流下，还有一个巨大的河谷平原——我的族人就生活在那儿。","source_cn":"我记得那宏伟又连绵不断的山脉，河水从山上奔腾咆哮着流下，还有一个巨大的河谷平原——我的族人就生活在那儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03E98DE5C6B1FA18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female